'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TOR', 'TPR', 'TSB', 'TSP', 'UGIN', 'UGL', 'ULG', 'UMA', 'UND', 'UNF', 'UNH', 'USG', 'UST', 'V13', 'V14', 'VIS', 'VMA', 'VOC', 'VOW', 'W16', 'W17', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'WOE', 'WOT', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNR']
original_text: ["(Walls can't attack.)", 'Add o\\nBo\\nBo\\nB to your mana pool.', 'Arc Lightning deals 3 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or players.', 'At end of turn, if there are no creatures in play, sacrifice Pestilence.\\noo\\nB Pestilence deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, each opponent loses 1 life. You gain life equal to the life lost this way.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if an opponent controls more lands than you, you may search your library for up to three basic land cards, reveal them, then put them into your hand. If you do, shuffle your library.', 'B', 'Choose one Target player gains 3 life; or prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays o3.', 'Counter target spell.', 'Cycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability any time you could play an instant.)\\nDrifting Meadow comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nW to your mana pool.', 'Cycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability any time you could play an instant.)\\nPolluted Mire comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nB to your mana pool.', 'Cycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability any time you could play an instant.)\\nRemote Isle comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nU to your mana pool.', 'Cycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability any time you could play an instant.)\\nSlippery Karst comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool.', "Destroy all creatures or all lands. Creatures destroyed this way can't be regenerated.", "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy all enchantments.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Each opponent discards two cards from his or her hand.', 'Each player discards his or her hand and draws cards equal to the greatest number a player discarded this way.', 'Each player puts a creature card from his or her graveyard into play.', "Each player returns a creature he or she controls to its owner's hand.", "Enchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchanted creature gets +1/+3.\\noo\\nW Return enchanted creature to its owner's hand.", "Enchanted creature gets +2/+2 and can't block.", 'Enchanted creature gets -2/-1.', "First strike\\nWhen Nekrataal comes into play, destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'First strike\\noo\\nW Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Flying', 'Flying; haste (This creature may attack and oc\\nT the turn it comes under your control.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever Abyssal Specter deals damage to a player, that player discards a card from his or her hand.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature is put into a graveyard from play, if Sengir Vampire dealt damage to it this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on Sengir Vampire.', 'Flying\\noc\\nT: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'G', 'Haste (This creature may attack and oc\\nT the turn it comes under your control.)', 'Heat Ray deals X damage to target creature.', 'Hurricane deals X damage to each creature with flying and each player.', 'Islandwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls an island.)\\noo\\nG Regenerate River Boa.', "Lhurgoyf's power is equal to the number of creature cards in all graveyards and its toughness is equal to that number plus 1.", "Pincher Beetles can't be the target of spells or abilities.", 'Protection from white\\no1oo\\nR Wildfire Emissary gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Put target creature card from a graveyard into play under your control. You lose life equal to that creature's converted mana cost.", 'R', 'Remove target creature from the game. Its controller gains life equal to its power.', "Return Broken Fall to its owner's hand: Regenerate target creature.", 'Rolling Thunder deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or players.', 'Sacrifice Sanctum Guardian: The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to target creature or player this turn, prevent that damage.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Phyrexian Ghoul gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Sandstorm deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.', "Set aside all creature cards in all graveyards. Then put each creature that's in play into its owner's graveyard. Then put each creature card set aside this way into play under its owner's control.", 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', 'Shower of Sparks deals 1 damage to target creature and 1 damage to target player.', 'Skyshroud Elite gets +1/+2 as long as an opponent controls a nonbasic land.', 'Spike Colony comes into play with four +1/+1 counters on it.\\no2, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Colony: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Spike Feeder comes into play with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\no2, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: You gain 2 life.', 'Spike Weaver comes into play with three +1/+1 counters on it.\\no2, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Weaver: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\no1, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Weaver: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Spike Worker comes into play with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\no2, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Worker: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Steam Blast deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.', 'Syphon Soul deals 2 damage to each other player. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target player draws four cards.', 'Two target creatures each get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'U', 'Untap target creature an opponent controls and gain control of it until end of turn. That creature gains haste until end of turn. (It may attack and oc\\nT the turn it comes under your control.)', 'W', 'When Cackling Fiend comes into play, each opponent discards a card from his or her hand.', "When Man-o'-War comes into play, return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Whenever Seasoned Marshal attacks, you may tap target creature.', 'Whenever a creature is put into a graveyard from play, put a +1/+1 counter on enchanted creature.', "Whenever a creature is put into a graveyard from play, that creature's controller may draw a card.", 'Whenever an opponent plays a land, put a +1/+1 counter on Dirtcowl Wurm.', 'Whenever another creature comes into play, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, it produces an additional one mana of any color.', 'You control enchanted creature.', "o0: Return Blinking Spirit to its owner's hand.", 'o1oo\\nG Target creature blocks Trumpeting Armodon this turn if able.', 'o1oo\\nW Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn by target attacking creature with flying.', 'o2oo\\nG Plated Rootwalla gets +3/+3 until end of turn. Play this ability only once each turn.', 'o\\nB, Pay 1 life: Sewer Rats gets +1/+0 until end of turn. No more than o\\nBo\\nBo\\nB may be spent this way each turn.', 'o\\nG, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Elvish Lyrist: Destroy target enchantment.', 'o\\nG, oc\\nT, Sacrifice a forest: Regenerate target creature.', 'o\\nUoo\\nU Tap target creature without flying.', 'o\\nW, oc\\nT: Tap target creature.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool.', "oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nB or o\\nR to your mana pool. Cinder Marsh doesn't untap during your next untap phase.", "oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nG or o\\nW to your mana pool. Vec Townships doesn't untap during your next untap phase.", "oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nR or o\\nG to your mana pool. Mogg Hollows doesn't untap during your next untap phase.", "oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nW or o\\nU to your mana pool. Thalakos Lowlands doesn't untap during your next untap phase.", 'oc\\nT: Counter target spell unless its controller pays o1.', 'oc\\nT: Fire Ants deals 1 damage to each other creature without flying.', 'oc\\nT: Prevent the next 2 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', 'oc\\nT: Prodigal Sorcerer deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'oc\\nT: Target attacking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'oc\\nT: Untap target creature.', 'oc\\nT: Untap two target lands.', 'oo\\nR Regenerate Uthden Troll.', 'oo\\nU Manta Riders gains flying until end of turn.']
original_type: ['Creature - Ape', 'Creature - Cleric', 'Creature - Drake', 'Creature - Druid', 'Creature - Efreet', 'Creature - Elemental', 'Creature - Elephant', 'Creature - Elf', 'Creature - Faerie', 'Creature - Goblin', 'Creature - Imp', 'Creature - Insect', 'Creature - Jellyfish', 'Creature - Lhurgoyf', 'Creature - Lizard', 'Creature - Merfolk', 'Creature - Nekrataal', 'Creature - Pegasus', 'Creature - Rat', 'Creature - Snake', 'Creature - Soldier', 'Creature - Specter', 'Creature - Spike', 'Creature - Spirit', 'Creature - Troll', 'Creature - Vampire', 'Creature - Wall', 'Creature - Wizard', 'Creature - Wurm', 'Creature - Zombie', 'Enchant Creature', 'Enchant Land', 'Enchantment', 'Instant', 'Land', 'Sorcery']
